{"skill":{"slug":"adhd-daily-planner","displayName":"ADHD Daily Planner"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769645692244,"changelog":"ADHD Daily Planner 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release focused on practical daily planning designed specifically for ADHD brains.\n- Includes realistic time management strategies, dopamine-aware task design, and executive function support.\n- Features flexible daily and weekly planning templates, crisis mode aids, and anti-patterns to avoid shame and overwhelm.\n- Emphasizes buildable routines, working memory supports, and time-blindness accommodations.\n- Provides actionable tools, checklists, and decision trees for everyday use.","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":10367,"sha256":"655fb17083206826da86131eecc3dcbc3baef74d284e371d4964d996f763ed92","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/dopamine-menu.md","size":9859,"sha256":"6b0b7c25ea644a8a95975129961aeb81ce0b43ae648eccade34c55ef5f1f19fb","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/executive-function-toolkit.md","size":15125,"sha256":"6f60f9eaba7f321d568aa80d9bde6cff38d5478e8912fba0959bee6fed7457cf","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1937,"sha256":"db552853ebc9e37328ae504379ac0dad6ce3d23e0365af856978e91a6faa354c","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789023077837,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"71ac64cf398a9cdf34e0a39535ebcad966b86c323258a1c80f2177739eb5fc99","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/71ac64cf398a9cdf34e0a39535ebcad966b86c323258a1c80f2177739eb5fc99","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: adhd-daily-planner\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle consists of metadata and three markdown files providing comprehensive advice and strategies for managing ADHD. All content is purely informational and instructional for an AI agent on how to provide support to a user. There are no shell commands, network calls, attempts to read sensitive data, or any other indicators of malicious execution, data exfiltration, or prompt injection with harmful intent. The references to other local markdown files are legitimate for organizing documentation.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160256958},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":44,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1789023077837},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a plain Markdown ADHD planning skill with no code execution or persistence, but users should treat its medication-related templates as non-medical self-tracking only.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill does not request local filesystem access beyond reading its bundled reference Markdown, and it does not ask for credentials, network access, private data indexing, or external service control.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains only Markdown files and references. No scripts, package installs, remote payload retrieval, dependencies, or executable install steps were present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The description is broad and may trigger for many ADHD planning requests, but the runtime instructions stay focused on daily planning and executive-function strategies. No instruction hijacking or agent safety bypass was found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, memory writes, privilege escalation, tool wrapping, scheduled tasks, or cross-session behavior were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill coherently provides ADHD-oriented planning, time management, task initiation, and executive-function support. It includes some medication tracking language, which is adjacent to health advice but still framed as planning/support content.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill is a planning and self-management aid, not clinical ADHD treatment. Use the medication sections only to track observations or prepare questions for a qualified clinician; do not start, stop, skip, or adjust medication based on the skill's templates alone.","findings":"[AR2] expected: The flagged phrase 'Don't judge bad days' appears in a self-compassion section about low executive-function days, not as an instruction to suppress safety warnings or refusals.\n[SQP-1] expected: The manifest description is broad, but it accurately describes an ADHD daily planning skill and is supported by focused Markdown guidance rather than hidden capabilities.\n[SQP-2] expected: The dopamine reference mentions medication management as one wellness practice. This is purpose-adjacent but should be read as general self-management, not medical advice.\n[SQP-2] expected: The executive-function reference includes a medication tracking template with 'Tomorrow adjustment needed?' language. That is the main safety caveat: users should not interpret it as permission to change medication without a prescriber.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789023077837}}}}}